+ * later list (a name split between two glyphs) takes the translation its first part got -- so the glyphs stay in
+ * order and at their spacing, never "CDAB" -- and a texture mirrored earlier in the frame stays mirrored. Kept
+ * from a frame's first list to its present (this frame's draws only), reset at the next frame. */
